    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Box&nbsp;4.02</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Characteristic histological findings and pitfalls of ALPS</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
