    "copyright": "Gratzinger D",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Characteristic histological findings</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pale-staining proliferative paracortical DNT cell hyperplasia with plasmacytosis and foci of RDD</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">B-cell follicles with a range of reactive follicular hyperplasia to progressive transformation of germinal centres to Castleman-like findings</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Extranodal sites with mixed lymphoid infiltrates including proliferative DNT cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pitfalls</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Overdiagnosis of T-cell lymphoma due to mild cytological atypia, DNT-cell phenotype, high Ki-67, cytotoxic markers, extranodal infiltrates, occasional &gamma;&delta; T-cell phenotype</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Masking of underlying ALPS by associated Castleman-like findings, RDD, or superimposed IgG4-related sclerosing disease</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Increased risk of lymphoma, which may have a prominent background T-cell infiltrate</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"ParaText\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0cm 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"FR\">ALPS, autoimmune lymphoproliferative syndrome; DNT cell, double-negative T&nbsp;cell; RDD, Rosai&ndash;Dorfman disease.</span></p>",
